{"schemaVersion":"galpedia-static-detail-model-v1","dataRevision":"a0c0367b8270b080feef0ef1fe65522144dc62343feb9d752729d92867d0d639","workId":"9417","model":{"presentationWorkId":"egs:9417","staff":{"artwork":[{"creditedName":"双羽純","creatorId":"egs:creator:33429","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:33429","canonicalEntityId":"egs:creator:33429","name":"双羽純","roleCode":"artwork","roleLabel":"原画","identityStatus":"no-alias-hit","relationId":"egs:work-creator:204510","source":"egs"}],"scenario":[],"music":[],"other":[{"creditedName":"Point Pictures(株式会社ポイント・ピクチャーズ)","creatorId":"vndb:s5820","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:14524","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s5820","name":"Point Pictures(株式会社ポイント・ピクチャーズ)","detail":"アニメーション","roleCode":"other","roleLabel":"其他","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:84281","source":"egs"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_bangumi_36074","characterName":"帕梅拉·伊碧斯","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"36074","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"11436"},{"characterId":"36074","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"138202"},{"characterId":"36074","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"19494"},{"characterId":"36074","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"2250"},{"characterId":"36074","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"249447"},{"characterId":"36074","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"283338"},{"characterId":"36074","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"310881"},{"characterId":"36074","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"41265"},{"characterId":"36074","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"41271"},{"characterId":"36074","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"41272"}]},"originalCharacterName":"帕梅拉·伊碧斯","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"工作室系列的吉祥物之一。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"在不同的世界观下，身世、性格稍有不同。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"--------------------------------------------------"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A4"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"最早登场是在メッテルブルグ宿屋的某房间，是在那里住了几十年的幽灵。以前那个房间因为有幽灵的传说，所以没人敢住。不过，后来尤蒂入住其中，并告诉大家帕梅拉并不是什么可怕东西的事实，于是那个房间又变得格外受欢迎了起来。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A5"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"25年后，原来的幽灵房间要事先预约也变得非常困难。但随着尤蒂回到自己的时代之后，帕梅拉渐渐开始有些觉得寂寞了，表情也没有以前看起来那么快乐。她也正在寻找新的朋友。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A6"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"アレーキア洞窟封印龙的祭品，后来成为幽灵后住过下水道、古堡、图书馆……虽然遇见过炼金很多代主角了、经历过很多冒险了，不过总是失忆的特性使得她仍如小白一般单纯天真。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A9"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"资料馆的幽灵，以惊吓学生为乐，剧情中加入了主角维恩所在的炼金工房，曾和现任校长是同学。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"拥有该作最强技能，而且使用门槛很低。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A11"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ロロナが拾ったクマのヌイグルミに宿っていた幽霊。悲壮感を感じさせないおっとりとした性格で後に自分のお店「パメラ屋さん」をオーブンする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A12"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"トトリが住むアランヤ村にあるパメラ屋さんの店主。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"何年か前にアーランドからやって来て、気づいたら店を開いていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"のんびりぽや～っとした性格で、あまり物事を深く考えたりしない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"お店の管理もちゃんとできているのか、やや怪しいところがある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"見た目は若いが、年齢は不詳。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"どうやら昔のことはあまり覚えていないらしい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A13"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"经营量贩店，DLC可加入为战斗角色。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A17"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"教会のシスター。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"おっとり、ほんわかとした性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"常に間延びした口調でしゃべり、周囲を無意識に和ませる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"教会の仕事をほぼ一人で切り盛りしている他、街の子供たちを預かる託児所を開いているなど、わりと働き屋。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"街の老人に対しても子供のように接するなど、彼女の年齢は謎。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A18"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"為了修女研修，離開家鄉基爾亨‧貝爾，出來旅行的修女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"但是在結束修女的培訓之後，因為買了太多土產導致盤纏都花完的關係，她不得不在萊森貝格經營店鋪工作賺錢。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"總是從容不迫，也令人摸不著頭緒的個性。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A19"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"キルヘン・ベルでシスターを務めていた女性。今はヴェーニュ教会で、グレースとともにシスターの仕事に励んでいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"キルヘン・ベルに戻るはずがなぜかメルヴェイユ行きの馬車に乗ってしまい、今は故郷に帰ることを目標に路銀を貯めている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ぽわわんとした性格で、シスターとしての実力もある、教会でもかなりの人気者。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A20"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"在亚尔兹经营【帕梅拉的店】的女性。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"因为个性温和又带着轻飘飘的感觉，让她的店成为亚尔兹的观光景点之一。似乎是萝乐娜的旧识。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A21"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"在库肯港初次登场。主线剧情后期，帕梅拉会作为旅行者在库肯港出现，并伴随一系列相关的支线任务。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A22"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本作在王都初次登场。带着大量布丁，想把布丁推广到全世界。 机缘巧合加入了朵拉莉亚“盗贼”团，帮助盗贼团找到装满金币的宝箱分给了穷人们，盗贼团也帮助了帕梅拉推广布丁的愿望。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"36074"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/23/2304ac8c4bcdb34ff998c6c80281fdb7c6fa967e31baa0fc9baf2219a49d3c1e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/af/afc34afc0557da8bf2a66c4a771137c06db970ca0d77810b85834ceeddb1208e.webp","width":187,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"利田優子","creatorId":"vndb:s8724","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s8724","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s8724","name":"利田優子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:41265:36074:15131:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_78455","characterName":"Hermina","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"78455","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"41261"},{"characterId":"78455","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"41265"}]},"originalCharacterName":"Hermina","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"36"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"0114"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"165"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"53"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"10岁时登场于《莉莉的工作室》，作为孤儿的她与人生劲敌英格丽一起由莉莉照顾，那时候起被称作神童的两人就互不相让。,因为小海美娜的身体很小，又有点虚弱，所以这只萝莉喜欢呆在图书室内。,那时海美娜的性格是顺从、安静的，但她绝不是很好接触的人，与之交谈虽然礼貌但总有种寒冷的感觉。,在经历了《海美娜与库鲁斯～莉莉的工作室～另一个故事～》中的生离死别后，性情大变的海美娜踏上了寻找老师莉莉的旅途，她一度旅行到斯特沃大陆极东地区的格拉姆纳特，并在《尤蒂的工作室～古拉姆纳特的炼金术士～》中成为可操控角色。,18岁的海美娜外表阴暗兼之喜欢黑魔法，甚至被害怕她的平民当成了女巫。,36岁登场于《艾莉的工作室》，回到了母校萨尔布鲁克炼金学院并成为了一名人民教师。执掌教鞭的她仍旧给人一种阴暗的感觉，是不同于英格丽老师额头爆满青筋的另一种恐怖。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"78455"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/57/571ef3b6a6ace9dd8c76e2e4b877344efb03588a8bf921872694b319a098a764.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ac/ac86c1e8728cc2f568878f8d42e66dcbb88a0ec7f698b31e1eadec7ff80e47c7.webp","width":191,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_78458","characterName":"ユーディー","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"78458","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"249447"},{"characterId":"78458","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"41265"},{"characterId":"78458","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"41266"}]},"originalCharacterName":"ユーディー","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"16"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"1010"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"160"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"50"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"继承家业经营着魔法药店的炼金术士少女，性格开朗活泼而有些冒失。一次在调和道具龙之沙漏（作用类似于时之石板，可以静止怪物的时间一会儿）时不小心掉了一根头发进入大锅，结果发生意外而来到了200年后的未来。她一面靠着炼金术维持生活，一面寻找着回自己时代的方法。游戏中她只与女性角色有感情戏，所以本作也被部分玩家划分为百合系。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"78458"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"职业","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"78458","value":"炼金术士"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/43/43587131185eeb20d843b41f17221591d00d0bbd5ce564a51a28a8c7b773ed22.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b2/b21f25557e9c81370aa2f7871120cbfec11ee7ebae35067f5118db5e17d33aec.webp","width":181,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"神田理江","creatorId":"vndb:s858","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s858","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s858","name":"神田 理江","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:41265:78458:4618:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_78459","characterName":"ヴィトス・ロートス","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"78459","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"41265"},{"characterId":"78459","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"41266"}]},"originalCharacterName":"ヴィトス・ロートス","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"20"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"0102"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"172"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"55"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"隶属于商会的青年，一个放高利贷的新手，,是尤蒂来到200年前的世界，所遇到的第一个人。,为人喜欢金钱，讨厌负债。,很会做生意，对女性不太拿手，很会算账，,王国内外，甚至连小道消息他都能够知道，,有时还会带着自己的眼镜进行一些细小的工作"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"78459"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"星座","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"78459","value":"摩羯座"},{"label":"职业","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"78459","value":"商人(放高利贷的）"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ed/ed460bdc67430db3252534368100854e2845d032eb74a9b43b29f48a7d4d05bf.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cf/cf0c57f85cf54022c0490620545be74835e4e8c098f08a4061f341e7429e0c47.webp","width":170,"height":241,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_78460","characterName":"Sphere","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"78460","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"41265"},{"characterId":"78460","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"41266"}]},"originalCharacterName":"Sphere","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"35"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"140"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"23"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"喜欢：甜点；,讨厌：苦的东西、恐怖故事；,梦想：在精灵界开蛋糕店。,外表看起来像是十岁左右小女孩的小不点，也是PSP版前作《尤蒂的工作室～格拉姆纳特的炼金术士～》中的新收录登场人物，在前作中不但失去记忆，甚至连名字也都忘记，会跟尤蒂在芬迪王国正中央山脉里面的古代遗迹“法克多亚神殿”中相遇；而25年过去了，在《薇欧蕾特的工作室～格拉姆纳特的炼金术士2～群青的回忆～》中她将再度迷路，并与女主角在卡洛迪（胡萝卜）遗迹相遇。在本作中，她依然还是一样说话很毒舌，不过或许是因为精神方面比前作要稍微成长一点，因此被其他角色当成小姐姐一般看待。,"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"78460"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/48/48585771bab96ee6289ceab721a1ee0ea9360ef5adc54cb7f19c59f54e8fe4c7.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0d/0dfc06c19ff689673ea91934c4d46c8897fd138714d9c6b5c4d520666dcb2332.webp","width":181,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"花澤香菜","creatorId":"vndb:s237","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s237","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s237","name":"花澤 香菜","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:41265:78460:4765:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_78461","characterName":"クリスタ・シュルツェ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"78461","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"249447"},{"characterId":"78461","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"41265"}]},"originalCharacterName":"クリスタ・シュルツェ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"16"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"0529"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"b"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"152"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"45"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"活跃在芬迪王国东南部，梅特尔布尔格，维尔伦，阿尔顿诺鲁多，法库托亚神殿附近，,以法库托亚神殿为中心的盗贼团的舒尔茨一家的独生女。,库莉斯塔本人也是盗贼，但是，不是犯罪者，而是一个普通的冒险家。,由于其父母在世界范围知名度过高，她周围的人都带着有色眼镜去看待她本人。,违法者聚集在阿尔顿诺鲁多，而在阿尔顿诺撸多周围的人把她看成是英雄一般的存在。,在梅特尔布尔格与里萨这样的城市中，即使是她什么都不做，别人也会抱以各种怀疑的眼神，,即便有时候她的周围有很多很亲近她的人，但是在和她行动时必须要谨慎。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"78461"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"星座","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"78461","value":"双子座"},{"label":"职业","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"78461","value":"冒险者"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3f/3f98d5f99a2e23375edee0d7d471011e0f726c99b7c634575c871985192d9d4c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/93/93b476932771c896561315e013dcf84d9428b92d05a15b260c7008e256cd4a35.webp","width":256,"height":160,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"近藤光世","creatorId":"egs:creator:9527","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:9527","canonicalEntityId":"egs:creator:9527","name":"近藤光世","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:41265:78461:38965:1","source":"bangumi"}]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"vndb:p910","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:766","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p910","name":"ガスト","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-brand:9417:766","source":"egs"}],"missingStates":["confirmed-character-relation-missing","current-runtime-cover-unavailable","vndb-work-mapping-pending"],"source":"terminal-wiki-full-runtime-v7"}}
